NewBarkTown_ElmsLab_Text_ResearchRequest::
    .string "I'm one of PROF. ELM's assistants.\p"
    .string "He asked us to study how a new\n"
    .string "partner grows with a TRAINER.\p"
    .string "Your journey with a KANTO partner\n"
    .string "could help with that research.$"

NewBarkTown_ElmsLab_Text_CyndaquilOffer::
    .string "This CYNDAQUIL is ready to travel.\n"
    .string "Will you take it along?$"

NewBarkTown_ElmsLab_Text_Received::
    .string "Thank you! CYNDAQUIL is still\n"
    .string "young, so help it grow at its pace.\p"
    .string "Try walking together and sharing\n"
    .string "the sights of JOHTO.$"

NewBarkTown_ElmsLab_Text_AlreadyReceived::
    .string "ELM already entrusted CYNDAQUIL\n"
    .string "to you for his research.\p"
    .string "A partner from OAK's aide counts,\n"
    .string "too. We share those records.\p"
    .string "Every journey with a partner\n"
    .string "teaches us something new.$"

NewBarkTown_ElmsLab_Text_Decline::
    .string "That's fine. We'll care for\n"
    .string "CYNDAQUIL until you're ready.$"

NewBarkTown_ElmsLab_Text_ResearchReportDelivered::
    .string "MR. POKEMON has new findings?\n"
    .string "Thanks for bringing his report.\p"
    .string "I will send these notes to ELM.\n"
    .string "They add to the KANTO records.\p"
    .string "OAK and BIRCH can compare their\n"
    .string "regional research with ours.\p"
    .string "The GUIDE GENT can help you\n"
    .string "continue exploring JOHTO.$"


NewBarkTown_ElmsLab_Text_ProfessorElm::
    .string "ELM: Welcome to NEW BARK TOWN!\n"
    .string "I am PROF. ELM, JOHTO's\l"
    .string "POKMON researcher.\p"
    .string "OAK told me about KANTO's\n"
    .string "new CHAMPION. I would like\l"
    .string "your help with our research.\p"
    .string "OAK, BIRCH, and I compare\n"
    .string "findings across our regions.\l"
    .string "Your POKDEX links that work.\p"
    .string "Speak to my assistant about\n"
    .string "our CYNDAQUIL partner study.\p"
    .string "MR. POKMON lives on ROUTE 30.\n"
    .string "Go west to CHERRYGROVE,\l"
    .string "then follow ROUTE 30 north.\p"
    .string "Speak to him, then return\n"
    .string "here with his research report.$"

NewBarkTown_ElmsLab_Text_ProfessorElmReport::
    .string "ELM: MR. POKMON's findings!\n"
    .string "Thank you for bringing them.\p"
    .string "They build on OAK's KANTO work\n"
    .string "and BIRCH's HOENN research.\p"
    .string "Continue to VIOLET CITY.\n"
    .string "The GUIDE GENT in CHERRYGROVE\l"
    .string "can explain the route.$"

NewBarkTown_ElmsLab_Text_ProfessorElmComplete::
    .string "ELM: We have your report.\n"
    .string "Our regional records are linked.\p"
    .string "Continue to VIOLET CITY and\n"
    .string "learn at the SPROUT TOWER.\p"
    .string "I look forward to hearing\n"
    .string "about your JOHTO partners.$"
